{
  "component": "p11",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "HOLD. THE WING HAS OPENED.",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I CAN SEE THAT.",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "CAN YOU SEE THE CORNER?",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 4,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I COULD IDENTIFY IT BLINDFOLDED.",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S A MOVING EXHIBIT.",
      "record_id": "P11.CHOICE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "JACKIE? YOU SAID YOU WERE STUCK. ARE YOU HURT?",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "WE'RE UNHURT. THE DISPLAY WING HAS US WEDGED IN.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 9,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "KEEP SUPPORTING IT. BUNNY CAN REACH THE PEG; I CAN\nREACH THE CATCH.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 11,
      "header_entry": 10,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S A MOVING EXHIBIT.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "LOVELY. SHALL WE HELP, OR WAIT FOR THE NEXT\nPERFORMANCE?",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 12,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I'D LIKE PEOPLE TO TRUST A REPAIR BECAUSE IT\nWORKS. NOT BECAUSE I'VE MADE A SPEECH.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU DO LIKE THE SPEECH.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I LIKE PEOPLE KNOWING I DID THE WORK.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I KEEP SAYING I CAN MANAGE EVERYTHING.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU CAN MANAGE THIS END. I CAN MANAGE THAT END.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "AND WE CAN ASK THEM TO MANAGE THE REST.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CATCH HAS TWO ARROWS POINTING INWARD. RELEASE\nIT AND THE WING FOLDS. WE'RE CARRYING THE WIDE\nVERSION FOR NO EXTRA MONEY.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE GATE'S PROPER HOLD-OPEN PEG IS ON THE FAR\nSIDE. BUNNY CAN REACH IT FROM THE PORCH.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 20,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FRANKIE CAN REACH THE CATCH FROM THE COURTYARD. I\nCAN REACH PLYWOOD WITH PARTS OF MYSELF I NORMALLY\nKEEP PRIVATE.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.003",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 21,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "BUNNY, PLEASE PUT THE GATE'S HOLD-OPEN PEG IN.",
      "record_id": "P11.CHOICE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE PEGGED. IT CAN'T SWING INTO YOU.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THANK YOU. I WAS RUNNING OUT OF PLACES TO BE HIT.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 24,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE PROPER PEG IS ALREADY IN. GOOD. ONE BIT OF\nTHIS DOESN'T NEED AN ELBOW.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FRANKIE, PLEASE RELEASE THE CATCH WITH THE INWARD\nARROWS.",
      "record_id": "P11.CHOICE.003",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 26,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CATCH RELEASED. NOW PULL THE DISPLAY HANDLE WITH\nFELIX. FOLD IT ONTO THE PADDED STOPS.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 10,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FOLD IT, DON'T FORCE IT. THE CATCH RELEASES THE\nWING. THE PASSAGE WON'T WIDEN JUST BECAUSE WE MAKE\nTHAT NOISE.",
      "record_id": "P11.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "WE NEED THE GATE HELD ON ITS PROPER PEG. BUNNY CAN\nREACH IT FROM THAT SIDE.",
      "record_id": "P11.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE WING CATCH IS STILL FASTENED. ASK FRANKIE TO\nRELEASE THE ONE WITH THE INWARD ARROWS.",
      "record_id": "P11.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "SET IT BACK ON THE CART.",
      "record_id": "P11.CHOICE.004",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "BACK ON THE PADDED CART. SAFELY. WE CAN WALK ROUND\nAND SORT IT OUT WITHOUT HAVING A CONVERSATION\nTHROUGH WOOD.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "TOGETHER. FOLD. ONTO THE PADDED STOPS. DOWN TO THE\nCART.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "LOVELY. I CAN BE A MAN AGAIN INSTEAD OF A SHELF.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 34,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "SHALL WE MOVE IT TOGETHER THIS TIME?",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 10,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "YES, PLEASE.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "TUCK IT INTO THAT RECESS. THE WALL HIDES IT UNTIL\nI'M READY. THANK YOU, ALL OF YOU.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 38,
      "header_entry": 37,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FOLDED AND PADDED ON THE CART, HIDDEN BEHIND THE\nHOUSE WALL. FROM THIS SIDE YOU'D NEVER KNOW IT HAD\nHAD TWO MEN STUCK TO IT.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.004",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU HAVE ENOUGH STRENGTH. YOU NEED HELP ON BOTH\nSIDES.",
      "record_id": "P11.HINT.1",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 41,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE GATE NEEDS ITS HOLD-OPEN PEG ENGAGED; THE WING\nNEEDS ITS INWARD-ARROW CATCH RELEASED. THEY'RE\nREACHABLE FROM OPPOSITE SIDES.",
      "record_id": "P11.HINT.2",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 42,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "ASK BUNNY TO ENGAGE THE GATE PEG AND FRANKIE TO\nRELEASE THE WING CATCH, IN EITHER ORDER. THEN PULL\nTHE DISPLAY HANDLE WITH FELIX AND LOWER IT ONTO",
      "record_id": "P11.HINT.3",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 43,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CART. YOU CAN SET IT BACK FIRST WHENEVER YOU\nLIKE.",
      "record_id": "P11.HINT.3",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 44,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERYONE IS SAFE, AND THE DISPLAY IS STAGED. SHALL\nWE SETTLE HOW WE TELL THE STORY?",
      "record_id": "VC03.ENTRY",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "A CONCISE HOUSEHOLD ACCOUNT, OR YOUR MORE\nELABORATE VERSION. BUNNY AND FRANKIE GET THEIR\nCREDIT EITHER WAY.",
      "record_id": "VC03.ENTRY",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 34,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "ALL FOUR OF US. AGREED. WE CAN PRACTICE BEFORE IT\nCOUNTS.",
      "record_id": "VC03.ENTRY",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 35,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "A REMATCH, ON THE SAME NARROW TERMS. WE CAN\nPRACTICE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC03.REMATCH",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 48,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 36,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE DISPLAY MUST BE SAFELY STAGED AND THE RESCUE\nCONVERSATION FINISHED FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC03.NOT_READY",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 50,
      "header_entry": 49,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "HOLD. THE WING HAS OPENED.",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I CAN SEE THAT.",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "CAN YOU SEE THE CORNER?",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 4,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I COULD IDENTIFY IT BLINDFOLDED.",
      "record_id": "P11.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "JACKIE? YOU SAID YOU WERE STUCK. ARE YOU HURT?",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "WE'RE UNHURT. THE DISPLAY WING HAS US WEDGED IN.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 9,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "KEEP SUPPORTING IT. BUNNY CAN REACH THE PEG; I CAN\nREACH THE CATCH.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 11,
      "header_entry": 10,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S A MOVING EXHIBIT.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "LOVELY. SHALL WE HELP, OR WAIT FOR THE NEXT\nPERFORMANCE?",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 12,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I'D LIKE PEOPLE TO TRUST A REPAIR BECAUSE IT\nWORKS. NOT BECAUSE I'VE MADE A SPEECH.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU DO LIKE THE SPEECH.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I LIKE PEOPLE KNOWING I DID THE WORK.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I KEEP SAYING I CAN MANAGE EVERYTHING.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU CAN MANAGE THIS END. I CAN MANAGE THAT END.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "AND WE CAN ASK THEM TO MANAGE THE REST.",
      "record_id": "P11.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CATCH HAS TWO ARROWS POINTING INWARD. RELEASE\nIT AND THE WING FOLDS. WE'RE CARRYING THE WIDE\nVERSION FOR NO EXTRA MONEY.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE GATE'S PROPER HOLD-OPEN PEG IS ON THE FAR\nSIDE. BUNNY CAN REACH IT FROM THE PORCH.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 20,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FRANKIE CAN REACH THE CATCH FROM THE COURTYARD. I\nCAN REACH PLYWOOD WITH PARTS OF MYSELF I NORMALLY\nKEEP PRIVATE.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.003",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 21,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE PEGGED. IT CAN'T SWING INTO YOU.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THANK YOU. I WAS RUNNING OUT OF PLACES TO BE HIT.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 24,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE PROPER PEG IS ALREADY IN. GOOD. ONE BIT OF\nTHIS DOESN'T NEED AN ELBOW.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "CATCH RELEASED. NOW PULL THE DISPLAY HANDLE WITH\nFELIX. FOLD IT ONTO THE PADDED STOPS.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 10,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FOLD IT, DON'T FORCE IT. THE CATCH RELEASES THE\nWING. THE PASSAGE WON'T WIDEN JUST BECAUSE WE MAKE\nTHAT NOISE.",
      "record_id": "P11.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "WE NEED THE GATE HELD ON ITS PROPER PEG. BUNNY CAN\nREACH IT FROM THAT SIDE.",
      "record_id": "P11.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "THE WING CATCH IS STILL FASTENED. ASK FRANKIE TO\nRELEASE THE ONE WITH THE INWARD ARROWS.",
      "record_id": "P11.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "BACK ON THE PADDED CART. SAFELY. WE CAN WALK ROUND\nAND SORT IT OUT WITHOUT HAVING A CONVERSATION\nTHROUGH WOOD.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "TOGETHER. FOLD. ONTO THE PADDED STOPS. DOWN TO THE\nCART.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "LOVELY. I CAN BE A MAN AGAIN INSTEAD OF A SHELF.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 34,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "SHALL WE MOVE IT TOGETHER THIS TIME?",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 10,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "YES, PLEASE.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "TUCK IT INTO THAT RECESS. THE WALL HIDES IT UNTIL\nI'M READY. THANK YOU, ALL OF YOU.",
      "record_id": "P11.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 38,
      "header_entry": 37,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FOLDED AND PADDED ON THE CART, HIDDEN BEHIND THE\nHOUSE WALL. FROM THIS SIDE YOU'D NEVER KNOW IT HAD\nHAD TWO MEN STUCK TO IT.",
      "record_id": "P11.LOOK.004",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERYONE IS SAFE, AND THE DISPLAY IS STAGED. SHALL\nWE SETTLE HOW WE TELL THE STORY?",
      "record_id": "VC03.ENTRY",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "A CONCISE HOUSEHOLD ACCOUNT, OR YOUR MORE\nELABORATE VERSION. BUNNY AND FRANKIE GET THEIR\nCREDIT EITHER WAY.",
      "record_id": "VC03.ENTRY",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 34,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "ALL FOUR OF US. AGREED. WE CAN PRACTICE BEFORE IT\nCOUNTS.",
      "record_id": "VC03.ENTRY",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 35,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "A REMATCH, ON THE SAME NARROW TERMS. WE CAN\nPRACTICE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC03.REMATCH",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 48,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 36,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I YIELD THE ACCOUNT. TELL IT YOUR WAY, WITH\nEVERYBODY CREDITED.",
      "record_id": "VC03.WIN",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 51,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 37,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FELIX AND I SUPPORTED THE DISPLAY. BUNNY SECURED\nTHE GATE, FRANKIE RELEASED THE CATCH, AND TOGETHER\nWE GOT IT SAFELY ONTO THE CART.",
      "record_id": "VC03.WIN",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 52,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 38,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I YIELD THE ACCOUNT. TELL IT YOUR WAY, WITH\nEVERYBODY CREDITED.",
      "record_id": "VC03.WIN",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 51,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 39,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FELIX AND I SUPPORTED THE DISPLAY. BUNNY WAS READY\nAT THE ALREADY SECURED GATE, FRANKIE RELEASED THE\nCATCH, AND TOGETHER WE GOT IT SAFELY ONTO THE",
      "record_id": "VC03.WIN",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 53,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 40,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "CART.",
      "record_id": "VC03.WIN",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 54,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 41,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I YIELD THE ACCOUNT. TELL IT YOUR WAY, WITH THE\nWHOLE TEAM CREDITED.",
      "record_id": "VC03.LOSS",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 55,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 42,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "JACKIE AND I KEPT THE DISPLAY SUPPORTED. BUNNY\nSECURED THE GATE; FRANKIE RELEASED THE CATCH. WITH\nALL FOUR DOING THEIR PART, WE FOLDED AND LOWERED",
      "record_id": "VC03.LOSS",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 56,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 43,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "IT SAFELY ONTO THE CART.",
      "record_id": "VC03.LOSS",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 57,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 44,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I YIELD THE ACCOUNT. TELL IT YOUR WAY, WITH THE\nWHOLE TEAM CREDITED.",
      "record_id": "VC03.LOSS",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 55,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 45,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "JACKIE AND I KEPT THE DISPLAY SUPPORTED. THE GATE\nWAS SECURED IN ADVANCE, WITH BUNNY READY ON THAT\nSIDE; FRANKIE RELEASED THE CATCH. WITH ALL FOUR",
      "record_id": "VC03.LOSS",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 58,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 46,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "DOING THEIR PART, WE FOLDED AND LOWERED IT SAFELY\nONTO THE CART.",
      "record_id": "VC03.LOSS",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 59,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 47,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "I YIELD THE ACCOUNT. TELL IT YOUR WAY, WITH\nEVERYBODY CREDITED.",
      "record_id": "VC03.WIN",
      "resource": 212,
      "entry": 51,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 37,
      "audio_module": 923
    },
    {
      "text": "FELIX AND I SUPPORTED THE DISPLAY. BUNNY SECURED\nTHE GATE, FRANKIE RELEASED THE CATCH, AND TOGETHER\nWE GOT IT SAFELY ONTO THE CART.",
      "record_id": "VC03.WIN",
